**Summary of Fix:**
- Track IME composition with `isComposing` in state.
- Prevent state updates to `inputValue` during composition.
- Update `inputValue` only after composition ends, allowing IME to work as expected.

This will resolve the issue and allow users to input Chinese (and other IME-based) characters in the ComboBox.
